{"id":"bewegt","lemma":"bewegt","pos":"adj","rank":1006,"glosses":["agitated, disturbed","moved, touched"],"ipa":"/bəˈveːkt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/63/De-at-bewegt.ogg/De-at-bewegt.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Er bewegt sich schnell.","en":"He moves quickly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/389188","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"quickly"}]},{"text":"Warum bewegt sich das Schiff nicht?","en":"Why isn't the ship moving?","words":[{"g":"why"},null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"ship"},{"g":"not"}]},{"text":"Der Mond bewegt sich um die Erde.","en":"The moon moves around the earth.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/787675","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"moon"},null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"around / at"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"earth"}]},{"text":"Seine Rede hat uns bewegt.","en":"His speech moved us.","words":[{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},{"g":"speech, address"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},null]},{"text":"Wartet dort und bewegt euch nicht!","en":"Wait there and don't move.","words":[{"g":"to wait","l":"warten"},{"g":"there, yonder"},{"g":"and"},null,{"g":"you (pl.)","l":"ihr"},{"g":"not"}]}]}